SHOWFILE MODE
     _S_h_o_w_f_i_l_e displays the results of a _m_a_k_e or _g_r_e_p. It is
     called by the E and S commands.  _S_h_o_w_f_i_l_e is called automat-
     ically in the course of an M or G command.  _S_h_o_w_f_i_l_e is
     essentially a special editor.  It has commands which allow
     one to display a file.  One can also command _s_h_o_w_f_i_l_e to
     examine a line of the file.  _S_h_o_w_f_i_l_e scans this line and
     attempt to extract a file name and line number.  _S_h_o_w_f_i_l_e
     then runs the editor, starting it at the specified line.

     These are the _s_h_o_w_f_i_l_e commands.  It is not necessary to
     press -Return- after these commands.  When a complete com-
     mand is sensed, it is run immediately.

     Command           Action

     number p          Print file starting at specified line.

     number e          Examine line for a file name and line
                       number.  If a file name is found, run the
                       editor on this file.

